            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Linn Boese"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I live in mango country (in West Africa), and made this today from windfall mangoes, soft from their fall in a windstorm, and blended, rather than using mango juice. It is delicious! I have lime juice available, not lemon juice, so used that. And I don't have lime zest, but it wasn't needed. The flavor is rich and the texture great.",
