            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Maggie Tidwell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for a brunch dessert yesterday and it was fabulous. I might have gone a little heavy on the fresh ginger but we all loved it. Served it with fresh strawberries and mango slices on the side and mint sprigs on top. Grogeous and delicious! Thank you.",
            "datePublished": "2013-06-24T16:30:43.767Z"
          },
          {
