            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Frozen solid when it came out of the freezer, but it softened pretty quickly sitting at room temperature. I like all of these flavors, but it was just a little too sweet for me, so I'd cut back on the sugar the next time.",
